{
  "_comment": "Not a real Schwung module -- chain_params lists the VST parameters of wumms_vst.cpp so mpc-vst-plugins' tools/gen_vst.py can generate params.h + the skin. Keys must match wumms_vst.cpp (KEYS[]). Start values the plugin sets itself (start_values()). Only append, never reorder; projects and presets restore by key.",
